 "text": "A single honest rating shouldn't beat the betting line season after season. Before the fix, the roster rating inherited from mmai did, in all 10 seasons with ESPN lines. That includes 2025-26 against DraftKings' lines (0.5371 vs 0.5411). Torvik's per-game player values are about half the team's own end-of-season rating, plus an opponent adjustment that also uses end-of-season ratings. After re-basing every game value on pre-game Kalman ratings, the same roster rating trails the line in 9 of 10 seasons, including 2025-26 (0.5547). Seasons before 2024 use ESPN's softer consensus lines."
